OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister rejects call to
OL,4,Aresign over Drumcree row
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Fdismissed a call from the Democratic
OL,8,FUnionist Party (DUP) to resign over her
OL,9,Frole in protests against the Drumcree
OL,10,Fparade.
OL,12,FThe Sinn Fein vice-president was
OL,13,Fbranded the "first minister of
OL,14,Flawlessness" as unionists criticised
OL,15,Fthe demonstrations on Garvaghy Road.
OL,17,FPolice are investigating the unlawful
OL,18,Fprotests which blocked an Orange Order
OL,19,Fmarch from passing along the mainly
OL,20,Fnationalist street in Portadown, County
OL,21,FArmagh.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
